{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261115/photo/bkn-20261115160116126-1115_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261115172220\"/><p>今早(15日)10時21分，一輛輕型貨車沿港深西部公路往深圳方向、駛至近新圍污水處理廠對開時，突然失控撞及一防撞欄。人員接報到場，發現姓吳(37歲)男司機身上有酒氣，經初步調查後，吳男未能通過酒精呼氣測試，涉嫌「酒後駕駛」被捕。他頭部受輕傷，被送往屯門醫院治理。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T09:38:50.406440+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T08:01:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T13:55:29.953557+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T09:32:28.550287+00:00","content_hash":"a79fc8224abed6159ffe78e638dd8224afb72f66b4c9e098a8790de80fd80037","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}